Package: tsco
Title: Two-Stage Conditional Odds Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Philip S.", family = "Boonstra", email = "phil@umich.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements two-stage conditional odds (TSCO) models for
    ordinal outcomes. Individual-level proportional-odds stages use rms and
    multinomial or grouped-count stages use VGAM.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
